# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# prefs: factory
# setup: benchpast
# Bench asks for the corner: the grip is drawn, and a drag inwards
# shrinks the frame while Bench keeps its least size behind it.
# Bench opens at the desk's top left, its tab under the global bar, so
# the window is never clicked by its tab here: the grip is what is used.
wait 60
click 980 30
wait 10
menu-pick Device Tools
wait 10
menu-pick TikuBench
wait 500
expect-title Bench
expect-window-at 15 3
note the grip: dark then light hairline, two pixels in from the corner
expect-pixel 970 668 cbcbcb
expect-pixel 970 669 ffffff
note dragged inwards by the grip: the window keeps its least size, and the
note desk shows where the window was
press 980 670
wait 4
move 940 630
wait 4
move 800 500
wait 4
move 700 440
wait 4
release 700 440
wait 30
expect-same-as-redraw
expect-pixel 900 600 336698
quit
